Package: pdf2md-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         python3-pyqt6,
         python3-pymupdf,
         python3-pip
Description: GUI for PyMuPDF4LLM — convert PDF files to Markdown
 Graphical interface for the pymupdf4llm library.
 Provides an easy way to convert PDF documents to
 Markdown format with image extraction, page selection,
 table detection, and other options.
 .
 Uses PyQt6 for the graphical interface and
 PyMuPDF4LLM as the conversion engine.
 .
 On first install, the package checks PyPI for the
 latest pymupdf4llm version and tests compatibility.
 If compatible, the latest version is used;
 otherwise the apt-provided version is kept.
